// ...


[(!) Characters Join At Level 1]
author=Trulio
description=(Save, close the game and disable this cheat after getting the characters)Freya, Brahms, Lenneth, Hrist, Silmeria and Valkryie will be level 1 when they join the party. Since they don't have level 1 stats, i made it the f up
